Id: lch001w
Severity: WARN
Category: boot
Check: check_launchd
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-5; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

A launchd job, or the program it runs, is writable past root.
Anyone who can rewrite the job chooses what runs at boot or
login; anyone who can swap the program runs as the job does.
Take it out of the writable state.
